description "Mercenary Thug

A rogues' gallery of wretched scumbags under contract. They favor cheap and dirty materials to get the job done.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Acidic Vibroaxe (Optional Yellow Saber)
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Poisons on hit
-- 33% thicker

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS3]"